- At 00:30 BST (which is 23:30 UTC the previous day), calling `nextGuernseyTime(1, 30)` — i.e., asking for 01:30 Guernsey time
- But at 01:00 BST, the clocks go back to 01:00 GMT (so 01:30 occurs twice, or at 02:00 BST the clocks spring forward)
- The offset at `now` may not match the offset at the target time

